@startuml sequence-success-flow
' Fluxo feliz da saga CreateOrder (orquestração)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #444444
  LifeLineBorderColor #999999
  ParticipantBorderColor #555555
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BoxBorderColor #BBBBBB
  DividerBackgroundColor #EEF2F7
  DividerBorderColor #BBBBBB
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}
autonumber "<b>[00]"

title Fluxo de Sucesso — Saga CreateOrder (Orquestração)

actor "Cliente" as C
participant "API Gateway" as GW
box "Order Service" #E8F1FB
  participant "Order API" as OA
  participant "Saga\nOrchestrator" as SO
  database "Order DB" as ODB
end box
queue "Message\nBroker" as MB #FFF4E0
box "Inventory Service" #E9F6EC
  participant "Inventory" as INV
  database "Inventory DB" as IDB
end box
box "Payment Service" #F3ECF9
  participant "Payment" as PAY
  database "Payment DB" as PDB
end box
participant "Gateway\nExterno" as EXT

== T1 — Criar pedido (síncrono, compensável por CancelOrder) ==
C -> GW : POST /orders {itens, meioPagamento}\nIdempotency-Key: k-123
GW -> OA : encaminha
OA -> ODB : BEGIN\n INSERT orders (status=PENDING)\n INSERT saga_instance (state=RESERVING_STOCK,\n   step_deadline=now+10s)\n INSERT outbox [ReserveStock]\nCOMMIT
note right of ODB
  PENDING funciona como
  **semantic lock**: nenhuma
  outra operação trata o pedido
  como definitivo
end note
OA --> GW : 202 Accepted {orderId, status: PENDING}
GW --> C : 202 Accepted

== T2 — Reservar estoque (assíncrono, compensável por ReleaseStock) ==
SO ->> MB : ReserveStock {sagaId, orderId, itens, messageId}
MB ->> INV : entrega (at-least-once)
INV -> IDB : BEGIN\n INSERT processed_messages (messageId)\n UPDATE stock (disponível -= qtd)\n INSERT reservations (status=RESERVED, expira em 15 min)\n INSERT outbox [StockReserved]\nCOMMIT
INV ->> MB : StockReserved {sagaId, reservationId}
MB ->> SO : saga.replies
SO -> ODB : UPDATE saga_instance\n SET state=PROCESSING_PAYMENT, version=version+1\n WHERE saga_id=? AND state=RESERVING_STOCK AND version=?\nINSERT outbox [ProcessPayment]

== T3 — Processar pagamento (transação PIVÔ) ==
SO ->> MB : ProcessPayment {sagaId, orderId, valor, messageId}
MB ->> PAY : entrega
PAY -> PDB : BEGIN\n INSERT processed_messages (messageId)\n INSERT payments (status=PROCESSING)\nCOMMIT
PAY -> EXT : POST /charges\nIdempotency-Key: sagaId\n(timeout 5s, circuit breaker)
EXT --> PAY : 200 APPROVED {transactionId}
PAY -> PDB : BEGIN\n UPDATE payments (status=APPROVED)\n INSERT outbox [PaymentApproved]\nCOMMIT
note right of PDB
  **Pivô**: após o pagamento
  aprovado a saga não volta
  mais — só avança
end note
PAY ->> MB : PaymentApproved {sagaId, transactionId}
MB ->> SO : saga.replies

== T4 / T5 — Confirmar (transações retentáveis, nunca compensadas) ==
SO -> ODB : UPDATE saga_instance SET state=CONFIRMING\nINSERT outbox [ConfirmReservation]
SO ->> MB : ConfirmReservation {sagaId, reservationId}
MB ->> INV : entrega
INV -> IDB : reservations.status=CONFIRMED\n(baixa definitiva do estoque)
INV ->> MB : ReservationConfirmed {sagaId}
MB ->> SO : saga.replies
SO -> ODB : BEGIN\n UPDATE orders SET status=APPROVED\n UPDATE saga_instance SET state=COMPLETED\n INSERT outbox [OrderApproved]\nCOMMIT

== Consulta do resultado ==
C -> GW : GET /orders/{orderId}\n(polling ou notificação via webhook/WebSocket)
GW -> OA : encaminha
OA --> C : 200 {status: APPROVED}

legend right
  |= Seta |= Significado |
  | ——> | chamada síncrona (HTTP / acesso ao banco) |
  | ——>> | mensagem assíncrona via broker |
  Toda escrita de estado + mensagem de saída ocorre
  na **mesma transação local** (Transactional Outbox).
endlegend
@enduml
